# FEATURED PRODUCTS

Create a visually attractive product grid.

Example products:

* Custom T-Shirts
* Sports Jerseys
* Custom Mugs
* Hoodies
* Tote Bags
* Cushions
* Caps
* Promotional Products

Each product card should contain:

