# HOW IT WORKS

Create a 4-step process.

### 01 — Share Your Design

Send your artwork or tell us what you need.

### 02 — Choose Your Product

Select apparel, gifts, promotional products, or other printing materials.

### 03 — Printing & Production

Our team prepares your design for printing and production.

### 04 — Ready for Delivery

Your customized products are prepared for collection or delivery.

Create a horizontal timeline on desktop and vertical timeline on mobile.

